  Skyler Baird
  Sep 24 •
  1 Nephi 14:7 For the time cometh, saith the Lamb
  of God, that I will work a great and a marvelous
  work among the children of men; a work which
  shall be everlasting, either on the one hand or on
  the other-either to the convincing of them unto
  peace and life eternal, or unto the deliverance of
  them to the hardness of their hearts and the
  blindness of their minds unto their being brought
  down into captivity, and also into destruction, both
  temporally and spiritually, according to the
  captivity of the devil, of which I have spoken.
  Alexander Dayton + 40
